<% content_for :title, "Public Domain Magic" %>

<main>
  <h1>Public Domain Magic</h1>

  <p>
    Restoring and freely sharing the great books of conjuring whose copyrights
    have lapsed into the public domain — carefully catalogued, cleared, and
    typeset for magicians everywhere.
  </p>

  <% if authenticated? %>
    <p>
      Welcome back, <%= Current.user.name %>. The library is being
      hand-assembled — come back soon.
    </p>
  <% else %>
    <p>
      The library is being hand-assembled. Come back soon, or
      <%= link_to "sign in", new_session_path %> if you have an account.
    </p>
  <% end %>
</main>
